Information it stores: Customer’s email, Stripe payment‑method ID – no raw card numbers.  Private? Yes.
Logins: Optional – if you already have auth you’ll tie the payment method to the user ID.  Money: Stripe chat‑paid card usage (~$0.50 per charge) – you’ll see the cost under your Stripe dashboard.
